@startuml
hide footbox
actor Operator
participant "React UI" as UI
participant "Spring Security / HTTP boundary" as Boundary
participant "analysis application" as Analysis
participant "AnalysisHistoryPort" as History
participant "JpaAnalysisHistoryAdapter" as Jpa
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Operator -> UI : open prior analyses for selected customer
UI -> Boundary : GET analysis history [HTTP/JSON]
alt unauthenticated
  Boundary --> UI : reject / redirect
  UI --> Operator : authentication required
else authenticated
  Boundary -> Analysis : listHistory(customerId, operatorContext) [in-process]
  Analysis -> History : listByCustomer(customerId) [in-process port]
  History -> Jpa : dispatch [in-process]
  Jpa -> DB : JDBC SELECT analysis_history by customer
  DB --> Jpa : persisted prior analyses
  Jpa --> History : AnalysisHistoryEntry[]
  History --> Analysis : AnalysisHistoryEntry[]
  Analysis --> Boundary : generation time + generating operator +\nrisk level + findings + recommendations
  Boundary --> UI : 200 JSON
  UI --> Operator : list and inspect previous result
end

note right of History
  FR-HIST-002 / AC-HIST-002 read path is distinct from persistence.
  Persistence infrastructure does not leak JPA rows through the port.
end note
@enduml
